            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Chindaalo chilikho chiicha nicho ese ndikholelamo niko nasuubisia babaandu ba Isiraeli ne Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise esio ese ndirobora omwami omuluungi khukhwama mu lisaaye lia Daudi. Omwami oyo alikhalaka bung'ali ne buluungi mu sibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ndaalo echo bamenywa ba Yuda balionisibwa ne bamenywa ba Yerusalemu baliliindwa bulayi. Ne lukoba lwa Yerusalemu lulilaangwa lisina bali, ‘Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ali buluungi bwefwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 7.12-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ke Ch. 17.11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, lisaaye lia Daudi se lilitamba omundu owikhala khu ndebe eye bubwami bwenju eya Isiraeli tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.3.5+NUM.3.6+NUM.3.7+NUM.3.8+NUM.3.9+NUM.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 3.5-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne lisaaye lia Lawi se lilitamba oaana biianwa bie khukhwosia, biianwa bie biakhulia ne chimbosio ebweeni wase khulwa mindali tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
