          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba khalobe be lisaaye lia Yakobo ne lisaaye lia Daudi omukholi wase ne se ndirobora omundu mube lisaaye liewe amiie lisaaye lia Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo tawe. Kali kario sikila ese khakoboselie babaandu base kimiaandu mala mbakholeele siisa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.26",
